  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Ring of Pain",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/7534/450x258/ring-of-pain-pc-mac-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795014000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/7534-buy-ring-of-pain-pc-mac-steam/",
      "user": "Rafael Z Amaral",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/30606658-1791888988.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Top!\n\n\n\nAs partidas (runs) são relativamente curtas, tornando clássico sentimento de \"só mais uma tentativa\" quase inevitável.\n\n\n\nTem centenas de itens e equipamentos desbloqueáveis, é possível criar sinergias criativas (focadas em velocidade, furtividade, veneno, defesa extrema ou dano explosivo).\n\n\n\nA abordagem de movimentação em círculo diferencia o jogo de praticamente todos os outros roguelikes de cartas do mercado."
    },
    {
      "game": "Remnant 2 - Ultimate Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/14372/450x258/remnant-2-ultimate-edition-ultimate-edition-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795014000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/14372-buy-remnant-2-ultimate-edition-ultimate-edition-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-a910eff",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Exceptionally in-depth game, featuring a riveting plot, re-playable content, and an immense amount of ways to play the game with friends. I'm having a great time, and I'm actually enjoying the harder difficulties for once, too. Normally, I don't play a souls-like game but this was AMAZING to play."
    },
    {
      "game": "Onimusha: Way of the Sword",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/7913/450x258/onimusha-way-of-the-sword-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795014000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/7913-buy-onimusha-way-of-the-sword-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-4f6ba2",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "As a non-souls like gamer. This was actually pretty good. I got frustrated on some ocasions but the easy mode made it possible for me to enjoy more the story. The combat itself is also satisfying and I played like 25h in 3 days so... it speaks for itself. The atmosphere, graphics, charracters and the voice acting are all top noch. They bring this game to life so to say. I would recomand this game to anyone that enjoyed the God of War games or Ghost of tsushima."
    },
